# Local reverse-proxy overlays. The tracked `docker-compose.yml` is the bare
# canvas service; each user assembles their own stack (Caddy sidecar, CF
# Tunnel, Tailscale, etc.) via override files kept out of git. See
# docs/reverse-proxy-examples/ for recipes.
